  "releaseNotes010": "Plan your day on one thread: drag a task to move it, drag its edge to change how long it takes, and shift everything after it in one go.\nAdd a task in two taps, type times in plain words, or paste a list to add several at once.\nRepeating tasks, reminders with lead times, and your calendars on the timeline — all free.\nSync between iPhone, Android, Mac and the web, with a status you can see and nothing lost.\nExport everything as JSON, CSV or a calendar file, and bring a backup back.\nSend feedback from Settings, and read what's new here after each update.",
  "@releaseNotes010": {
    "description": "Changelog notes for version 0.1.0; one item per line (each line becomes a bullet)."
  },
