  "releaseNotes110": "Speak it: tap the mic in Brain dump and say what's on your mind — pause, or say \"next\", to start a new task. The mic is in a task's notes too. Your words are turned into text on this device and never sent anywhere.\nAsk Siri: on iPhone, Settings › Siri & Shortcuts shows the five things you can ask, like \"What's next in Dottoday\".\nKnow who plans: Settings › Privacy says whether Apple Intelligence, Gemini Nano or your browser's built-in AI is helping on this device, and how to turn it on. Plans made with simple rules now say so.",
